    "summary": "A long, rectangular cloth, for a domestic interior.  Very brightly patterned bands (twill woven), alternating with solid purple ones.  [Thin green wool (with synthetic) warp; weft yarns are knitting rather than weaving yarn, giving a very soft handle.] Coloured bands have large diamond patterning; repeated in sequence along the cloth, using white and tones of pink, yellow, green, blue and red and thin silver-coloured plastic (?) tinsel thread.  Simple knot at fell edge.  Unused.",
